New shaman skill: ensoul.

1) Ensoul calls something into an opal and leaves a soulstone.
   - Five carats to a soulstone level, so a small opal makes a level one
     stone and only the greatest reach level ten.
   - An opal with no carats still answers, faintly.

2) It is paid for in lifeforce, and the price rises with the stone.
   - Ten landed calls for every carat of the opal.
   - Each draws on you at a rate set by the size of the stone, so a great
     opal is an undertaking rather than an afternoon.

See HELP ENSOUL and HELP SOULSTONE.
